' 07 Checkpoint, replay, and sweep: one deploy with a space transaction, from
' play on the proposer to replay on a validator.
'
' Source of Figure S7 in ../design.md (section S7). The figure restates the
' P1 substrate (rspace++/src/rspace/space_store_handle.rs and the two
' backends) and the host steps that it relies on: rig and check_replay_data
' (replay_rspace.rs), changes (hot_store.rs), and the radix delete of an
' absent key (history/radix_tree.rs). The reducer hooks are the calls that
' P4 and P7 add (decision 19, D1). The figure adds no new fact.
'
' Reading order, from the top to the bottom:
'   1. Play: the scope starts, the agent stages and commits one transaction,
'      and the sweep removes the volatile state at the end of the deploy.
'   2. Checkpoint: the hot store changes become history actions. The deletes
'      of swept keys find no leaf, so the root covers the durable state only.
'   3. Replay: rig binds the recorded COMM events, the agent stages the same
'      operations, verify pairs each fire under its trigger key, the commit
'      removes the bindings, and the sweep runs at the same point.
'   4. The replay checkpoint reaches the root of play.
'
' Colors come from concept-colors.iuml (aliases of the shared palette).
' Render: ./render.sh 07-checkpoint-replay-sweep.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startuml 07-checkpoint-replay-sweep
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor $rrs_relation
  LifeLineBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ParticipantBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ActorBorderColor $rrs_relation
  GroupBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
}
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam CollectionsBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam NoteBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
title Checkpoint, replay, and sweep of a deploy with a space transaction
autonumber

participant "Casper\nruntime" as CASPER $rrs_host
participant "Reducer\nroot evaluation" as RED $rrs_host
participant "Space agent\n(P4)" as AGENT $rrs_agent
participant "SpaceStoreHandle" as HANDLE $rrs_substrate
participant "SpaceTxn\n(HostTxn)" as TXN $rrs_substrate
participant "Host space\nRSpace, ReplayRSpace" as HOSTSPACE $rrs_host
collections "Event log, or\nreplay table" as LOG $rrs_host
database "Hot store" as HOT $rrs_storage
database "History trie" as HIST $rrs_storage

== Play on the proposer ==
CASPER -[$rrs_flow]> RED : evaluate the deploy
RED -[$rrs_flow]> HANDLE : begin_evaluation_scope()
note right of HANDLE : the tracker of parent orders resets (FR-5')
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> HANDLE : begin(lock keys)
HANDLE -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : begin(lock keys, registration)
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_relation]> HOSTSPACE : consume_lock: phase A,\nthen phase B, ascending
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_flow]-> AGENT : an open SpaceTxn
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> TXN : read data, continuations, joins
TXN -[$rrs_relation]> HOT : load the lists\n(history read-through)
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> TXN : stage produce or consume with an outcome
TXN -[$rrs_relation]> TXN : validate, compute the COMM:\n<latex>\mathit{times}(p) = \kappa_v(p) + [\neg \mathit{persist} \wedge p = \mathit{src}]</latex>
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> TXN : commit()
loop operation i under <latex>\mathit{parent} \mathbin{+\!\!+} [(i, 2)]</latex>
  TXN -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : read-only checks, then the play calls\nof the host operation
  HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> LOG : Produce, Consume, and COMM events
  HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> HOT : put and remove entries
end
TXN -[$rrs_flow]-> AGENT : receipts, locks released
RED -[$rrs_flow]> HANDLE : sweep_volatile(volatile channels of the deploy)
HANDLE -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : validate (read-only), then remove
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> HOT : remove continuations, joins, and data\nno event, no observer call

== Checkpoint ==
CASPER -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : create_checkpoint()
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_relation]> HOT : changes()
HOT -[$rrs_relation]-> HOSTSPACE : inserts of the durable keys,\ndeletes of the swept keys
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> HIST : process the actions
note right of HIST
A swept key has no leaf in the trie,
so its delete finds nothing and the
action drops (radix_tree.rs).
The root covers the durable state
only (H15, T2, T4).
end note
HIST -[$rrs_relation]-> HOSTSPACE : the new root
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_flow]-> CASPER : the checkpoint: root and event log
CASPER -[$rrs_relation]> CASPER : the block holds the deploy,\nthe event log, and the root

== Replay on a validator ==
CASPER -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : rig(event log), then reset to the pre-state root
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> LOG : bind each COMM under each\nof its logged IO events
CASPER -[$rrs_flow]> RED : evaluate the deploy again
RED -[$rrs_flow]> HANDLE : begin_evaluation_scope()
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> HANDLE : begin(lock keys)
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> TXN : stage the same operations
TXN -[$rrs_relation]> LOG : verify under the trigger key:\n<latex>\lfloor b / m \rfloor > \mathrm{paired}</latex>
alt a free recorded occurrence exists
  TXN -[$rrs_relation]> TXN : pair the COMM
  AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> TXN : commit()
  TXN -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : read-only checks, then the replay calls
  HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> HOT : put and remove entries
  HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> LOG : remove_bindings_for(COMM)
else no free occurrence
  TXN -[$rrs_fail]-> AGENT : ReplayDivergence at staging, no effect
end
RED -[$rrs_flow]> HANDLE : sweep_volatile at the same point as play
HANDLE -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : the same sweep, and the estimate\nof waiting continuations goes down
CASPER -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : check_replay_data()
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_relation]-> CASPER : no unused binding\n(otherwise UnusedCommEvent)
CASPER -[$rrs_flow]> HOSTSPACE : create_checkpoint()
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_effect]> HIST : the same actions
HIST -[$rrs_relation]-> HOSTSPACE : the new root
HOSTSPACE -[$rrs_flow]-> CASPER : the root of play (T1, T2)

legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$rrs_substrate>  | substrate of P1 |
|<$rrs_host>       | host at the baseline: runtime, reducer, host space, log |
|<$rrs_agent>      | space agent (P4) |
|<$rrs_storage>    | stored state |
**Arrows**
|<$rrs_flow>       | call or return |
|<$rrs_effect>     | effect on the host state |
|<$rrs_relation>   | read or internal step |
|<$rrs_fail>       | failure |
endlegend
@enduml
